  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multiannual action plan in favour of the Asia-Pacific region for 2025-2026 for strengthened EU-GCC cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action aims to enhance the EU-GCC partnership (both regionally as well as with individual countries in the region) in areas of mutual interest as well as the perception of the EU in the region. It will deepen the engagement between EU and GCC stakeholders in the area of climate change and promote the uptake of green transition policies and technologies by the GCC countries. It will also aim to enhance the social protection of migrants workers in the GCC region and deepen engagement between EU and GCC stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
